#: kcmstyle.cpp:802
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Here you can choose from a list of predefined widget styles (e.g. the way "
"buttons are drawn) which may or may not be combined with a theme (additional "
"information like a marble texture or a gradient)."
msgstr ""
"Equí pues escoyer dende un llistáu predefiníu d'estilos de widgets (exem: el "
"mou nel que se dibuxen los botones) que podríen o non combinase con un tema "
"(información adicional como una testura de mármol o dilíu)."

#: kcmstyle.cpp:806
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This area shows a preview of the currently selected style without having to "
"apply it to the whole desktop."
msgstr ""
"Esti área amuesa una previsualización del estilu esbilláu anguño ensin tener "
"qu'aplicalu a tol escritoriu."

#: kcmstyle.cpp:809
#, kde-format
msgid "This page allows you to choose details about the widget style options"
msgstr ""
"Esta páxina permítete escoyer los detalles tocante a les opciones d'estilu "
"de widgets"

#: kcmstyle.cpp:810
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p><b>No Text:</b> Shows only icons on toolbar buttons. Best option for low "
"resolutions.</p><p><b>Text Only: </b>Shows only text on toolbar buttons.</"
"p><p><b>Text Beside Icons: </b> Shows icons and text on toolbar buttons. "
"Text is aligned beside the icon.</p><b>Text Below Icons: </b> Shows icons "
"and text on toolbar buttons. Text is aligned below the icon."
msgstr ""

#: kcmstyle.cpp:817
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If you enable this option, KDE Applications will show small icons alongside "
"some important buttons."
msgstr ""

#: kcmstyle.cpp:819
#, kde-format
msgid ""
